:: objects speaker=analyst scene="evidence" beat="inspection"
> speaker=analyst portrait="tired" object=wire_recorder @t3key0n
  The wire carries a second breath beneath hers, too regular to be fear.
  ? object=wire_recorder tone="clinical" sfx=tape_hiss @turn_shutter
    Mark the breath pattern and compare it against the station switchboard.
    -> crate_check
  ? object=cipher_card tone="careful" requires=(has_item(station_log)) @copy_markings
    Match the cipher card to the night clerk's station log.
    -> terminal_check

:: crate_check speaker=narrator scene="evidence" beat="seal"
:if has_item(cipher_key)
  > speaker=analyst portrait="working" object=transit_seal @yc305e7
    The cipher key opens the seal record; the ink is fresh where history should be dry.
  ! deferred record_object(transit_seal)
> object=transit_seal @qx5xccq
  The transit seal places LACUNA south of the platform when the shot was logged north.
